---
description: Decide field-level findings for releaseTraining.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Assemble the adapted program with facilitator notes, terminology, and documented limits of applicability. Obtain audience and instructional review, version the relationship to the source program, and avoid presenting one adaptation as universal for an entire culture. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
